  "_section_20": "==================== MSSQL database resources ====================",
  "_comment_20": "managed=true: local infra script creates/updates the DB in the Podman MSSQL container.",
  "_comment_21": "managed=false: external DB; the app still uses connectionString/username/password, infra does not create/drop it.",
  "_comment_22": "schemaScript is a static DB-specific SQL file. It has no tokens or placeholders.",
